                            <i class="tw:bg-ink tw:block tw:h-1 tw:w-24 tw:left-0 tw:absolute tw:top-0 tw:max-[701px]:bg-ink tw:max-[701px]:h-1! tw:max-[701px]:absolute! tw:max-[701px]:w-24! tw:max-[701px]:block! tw:max-[701px]:flex-[0_0_4px]! tw:max-[701px]:left-0! tw:max-[701px]:top-0!"></i>
                            <h2 class="tw:text-4xl tw:left-0 tw:leading-[42px] tw:absolute tw:top-2.5 tw:m-0 tw:max-[701px]:text-4xl tw:max-[701px]:[font-variation-settings:'wdth'_75] tw:max-[701px]:font-bold tw:max-[701px]:leading-[42px] tw:max-[701px]:absolute! tw:max-[701px]:[text-box-edge:cap_alphabetic] tw:max-[701px]:[text-box-trim:trim-both] tw:max-[701px]:w-full tw:max-[701px]:left-0! tw:max-[701px]:top-5! tw:max-[701px]:m-0">Como avaliamos o legislativo</h2>
                        </header>
                        <p class="tw:w-205 tw:max-[701px]:text-lg tw:max-[701px]:leading-6 tw:max-[701px]:w-full">
                            Cada proposição percorre quatro etapas: coleta,
                            triagem pela IA, análise especializada e curadoria
                            editorial.
                        </p>
                        <h3 class="tw:text-[32px]! tw:leading-8 tw:mt-[26px]! tw:mb-0 tw:mx-0 tw:max-[701px]:text-[32px] tw:max-[701px]:leading-8 tw:max-[701px]:[text-box-edge:cap_alphabetic] tw:max-[701px]:[text-box-trim:trim-both] tw:max-[701px]:w-full tw:max-[701px]:mt-[26px] tw:max-[701px]:mb-0 tw:max-[701px]:mx-0">1. Coleta automatizada</h3>
                        <p class="tw:w-205 tw:max-[701px]:text-lg tw:max-[701px]:leading-6 tw:max-[701px]:w-full">
                            O raspador do Elas no Congresso está conectado às
                            APIs da Câmara dos Deputados e do Senado Federal. A
                            cada 24 horas, o código busca palavras-chave
                            temáticas e armazena título, autoria, ementa e
                            status na nossa API aberta. Se a ementa ou o texto
                            integral contiver os termos mapeados, a matéria
                            entra no fluxo de análise.
                        </p>
                        <aside class="tw:text-muted tw:text-[0] tw:leading-4 tw:mt-[-1px] tw:w-205 tw:[font:400_14px/16px_'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',_sans-serif] tw:before:text-muted tw:before:[content:none] tw:before:[font:400_14px/16px_'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',_sans-serif] tw:after:text-accent tw:after:[content:none] tw:after:[font:700_14px/16px_'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',_sans-serif] tw:max-[701px]:text-sm tw:max-[701px]:leading-4 tw:max-[701px]:w-full tw:max-[701px]:text-muted tw:max-[701px]:font-sans tw:max-[701px]:font-normal tw:max-[701px]:mt-[4px] tw:max-[701px]:mb-0 tw:max-[701px]:mx-0 tw:max-[701px]:before:[content:none] tw:max-[701px]:after:[content:none]">
                            Para ver todas as palavras, acesse a{" "}
                            <a class="tw:text-accent tw:[font:700_14px/16px_'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',_sans-serif] tw:underline tw:underline-offset-1 tw:hover:underline tw:focus-visible:outline-2 tw:focus-visible:outline-accent tw:focus-visible:outline-offset-1 tw:max-[701px]:text-accent tw:max-[701px]:font-sans tw:max-[701px]:text-sm tw:max-[701px]:font-bold tw:max-[701px]:leading-4 tw:max-[701px]:underline tw:max-[701px]:underline-offset-1"
